{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"carcass_bear","model_identifier":"carcass_bear","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# carcass_bear\n\nBear carcass: the bear lying on its side in its death pose, a node workers butcher into meat and hide.\n\n- Baked from `bear.bbmodel`: the final (held) frame of its `death` clip, frozen into the groups' rest rotations so it needs no animation.\n- Same texture and UV layout as the source animal (its variant textures also fit).\n- Hit box / interaction: workers butcher it from the side; use the lying body's footprint (see bounds in Blockbench).\n- When butchered out, replace with `carcass_bones`.\n"},"description":"# carcass_bear\n\nBear carcass: the bear lying on its side in its death pose, a node workers butcher into meat and hide.\n\n- Baked from `bear.bbmodel`: the final (held) frame of its `death` clip, frozen into the groups' rest rotations so it needs no animation.\n- Same texture and UV layout as the source animal (its variant textures also fit).\n- Hit box / interaction: workers butcher it from the side; use the lying body's footprint (see bounds in Blockbench).\n- When butchered out, replace with `carcass_bones`.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"torso","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.5,32.0,-18.0],"to":[10.5,50.5,13.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,45.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[31,51,52.0,69.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[78,31,109.0,49.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[52,51,73.0,69.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,51,31.0,69.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,21.0,31.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[21,0,42.0,31.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d39f6cef-00c8-5088-9143-9a56216737c4"},{"name":"rump","box_uv":false,"rescale":false